#SKIPTEST
' Change 1663: a variable with the name of a bit on the chip is an error.
' CON is bit 7 of CM1CON on the PIC18F46J50. Build 1662 only warned, and compiled "COn = PORTA" as bcf/bsf CM1CON,CON:
' the program changed a comparator bit instead of storing a byte.
' Expected (build 1663): Error: Variable name CON is the name of bit CM1CON.7 on the current chip: the compiler would use
' that bit, not a variable. Rename it (#define DISABLE1663 makes this a warning)
#chip 18F46J50, 48
#option explicit
Dim COn As Byte
Dir PORTB Out
Do
    COn = PORTA
    PORTB = COn
Loop
